ic 更新 Claude Fable 5 生物安全防护，误报率大幅降低","topic":"应用","publishedAt":"2026-08-08T00:01:00.022Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmsic9k6j18ghronkd6hbia5j","https://www.anthropic.com/news/improving-fable-5-s-biology-safeguards"],"articles":[{"id":"cmsic9k6j18ghronkd6hbia5j","title":"Anthropic 更新 Claude Fable 5 生物安全防护，误报率大幅降低","originalTitle":"","summary":"Anthropic 更新了 Claude Fable 5 的生物安全防护机制，将生物相关查询的“回退”次数减少约 85%，用户在日常健康与教育问题上将更少遇到系统切换至较弱模型的情况。此次更新扩大了模型可协助的生物任务范围，但涉及双重用途的病毒学、毒理学和分子设计请求仍会回退至 Opus 5。Anthropic 表示正通过可信访问途径，致力于缩小专业生物研究与药物开发领域的差距。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsic9k6j18ghronkd6hbia5j","originalUrl":"https://www.anthropic.com/news/improving-fable-5-s-biology-safeguards","publishedAt":"2026-08-08T00:01:00.022Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-15gzes8","originalSourceName":"Anthropic：Newsroom（网页）","family":"anthropic","kind":"official","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"产品发布/更新","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsic9k6j18ghronkd6hbia5j","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-07T20:48:56.475Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-15gzes8","name":"Anthropic：Newsroom（网页）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-07T20:48:56.475Z"}],"sectionLabel":"产品发布/更新","reportSummary":"Anthropic 更新了 Claude Fable 5 的生物安全防护机制，将生物相关查询的“回退”次数减少约 85%，用户在日常健康与教育问题上将更少遇到系统切换至较弱模型的情况。此次更新扩大了模型可协助的生物任务范围，但涉及双重用途的病毒学、毒理学和分子设计请求仍会回退至 Opus 5。Anthropic 表示正通过可信访问途径，致力于缩小专业生物研究与药物开发领域的差距。","reportEdition":"2026-08-08","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news