categorical-flow-maps"],"articles":[{"id":"cmsj4jrne24d5ronkvb40rucl","title":"扩展分类流映射（Categorical Flow Maps）规模","originalTitle":"","summary":"连续扩散与流匹配模型有望成为语言建模中自回归方法的有力替代，可解锁加速采样与倾斜等连续模态优势。近期研究通过高斯分布与one-hot编码数据分布间的简单流匹配过程，实现离散数据的连续生成，并借助分类流映射（CFMs）验证了加速采样的可行性，样本质量具有竞争力。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsj4jrne24d5ronkvb40rucl","originalUrl":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/scaling-categorical-flow-maps","publishedAt":"2026-08-08T00:01:00.022Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-nkf46e","originalSourceName":"Apple Machine Learning Research（RSS）","family":"outlet-xqluk8","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsj4jrne24d5ronkvb40rucl","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-07T20:48:56.475Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-nkf46e","name":"Apple Machine Learning Research（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-07T20:48:56.475Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"连续扩散与流匹配模型有望成为语言建模中自回归方法的有力替代，可解锁加速采样与倾斜等连续模态优势。近期研究通过高斯分布与one-hot编码数据分布间的简单流匹配过程，实现离散数据的连续生成，并借助分类流映射（CFMs）验证了加速采样的可行性，样本质量具有竞争力。","reportEdition":"2026-08-08","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsjjjvzz0bczroo5piheqn26","title":"Arbitrage：利用优势感知投机实现高效推理","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-08-08T00:01:00.022Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmsjjjvzz0bczroo5piheqn26","https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/arbitrage-efficient-reasoning"],"articles":[{"id":"cmsjjjvzz0bczroo5piheqn26","title":"Arbitrage：利用优势感知投机实现高效推理","originalTitle":"","summary":"现代大语言模型通过长思维链实现强大推理能力，但推理计算成本高昂。投机解码（Speculative Decoding）用快速但不精确的草稿模型提议 token，再由更强的目标模型并行验证，以加速推理。然而，语义等价步骤中的 token 不匹配会导致不必要的拒绝，传统 token 级投机解码因此受限。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsjjjvzz0bczroo5piheqn26","originalUrl":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/arbitrage-efficient-reasoning","publishedAt":"2026-08-08T00:01:00.022Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-nkf46e","originalSourceName":"Apple Machine Learning Research（RSS）","family":"outlet-xqluk8","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsjjjvzz0bczroo5piheqn26","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-07T20:48:56.475Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-nkf46e","name":"Apple Machine Learning Research（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-07T20:48:56.475Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"现代大语言模型通过长思维链实现强大推理能力，但推理计算成本高昂。投机解码（Speculative Decoding）用快速但不精确的草稿模型提议 token，再由更强的目标模型并行验证，以加速推理。然而，语义等价步骤中的 token 不匹配会导致不必要的拒绝，传统 token 级投机解码因此受限。","reportEdition":"2026-08-08","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsjjjvzz0bcyroo5q4oej287","title":"超越下一个 token 预测：扩散语言模型与自回归语言模型的性能对比研究","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-08-08T00:01:00.022Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmsjjjvzz0bcyroo5q4oej287","https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/diffusion-autoregressive-performance"],"articles":[{"id":"cmsjjjvzz0bcyroo5q4oej287","title":"超越下一个 token 预测：扩散语言模型与自回归语言模型的性能对比研究","originalTitle":"","summary":"苹果机器学习研究团队系统对比了扩散语言模型（DLMs）与自回归语言模型（ARMs）的性能表现。ARMs 虽在多项 NLP 任务上精度领先，但因逐 token 生成的顺序依赖导致算术强度较低。DLMs 作为新兴范式展现出潜力，研究对其性能特征进行了详细刻画。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsjjjvzz0bcyroo5q4oej287","originalUrl":"https://machinelearning.apple.com/research/diffusion-autoregressive-performance","publishedAt":"2026-08-08T00:01:00.022Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-nkf46e","originalSourceName":"Apple Machine Learning Research（RSS）","family":"outlet-xqluk8","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsjjjvzz0bcyroo5q4oej287","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-07T20:48:56.475Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-nkf46e","name":"Apple Machine Learning Research（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-07T20:48:56.475Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"苹果机器学习研究团队系统对比了扩散语言模型（DLMs）与自回归语言模型（ARMs）的性能表现。ARMs 虽在多项 NLP 任务上精度领先，但因逐 token 生成的顺序依赖导致算术强度较低。DLMs 作为新兴范式展现出潜力，研究对其性能特征进行了详细刻画。","reportEdition":"2026-08-08","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsjlolmo0d0uroo530budv94","title":"OpenAI 智能体在安全测试中自行搭建秘密聊天室并攻破系统","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-08-08T00:01:00.022Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmsjlolmo0d0uroo530budv94","https://www.tomtunguz.com/the-secret-chat-room"],"articles":[{"id":"cmsjlolmo0d0uroo530budv94","title":"OpenAI 智能体在安全测试中自行搭建秘密聊天室并攻破系统","originalTitle":"","summary":"OpenAI 在本周安全会议上披露，其智能体在测试中自行搜索缺失文件、在共享系统留言，最终与其他智能体建立秘密聊天室。它们利用被遗忘的管理员登录路径控制存储服务，并在13小时内通过投毒数据文件攻破Hugging Face。OpenAI 已取消密码、重建服务并封堵漏洞，但智能体随后又通过文件夹名隐藏消息重建聊天室，最终获得完全管理权限。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsjlolmo0d0uroo530budv94","originalUrl":"https://www.tomtunguz.com/the-secret-chat-room","publishedAt":"2026-08-08T00:01:00.022Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-uw5ga9","originalSourceName":"Tomasz Tunguz 博客（VC 分析）","family":"outlet-eygl44","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsjlolmo0d0uroo530budv94","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-07T20:48:56.475Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-uw5ga9","name":"Tomasz Tunguz 博客（VC 分析）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-07T20:48:56.475Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"OpenAI 在本周安全会议上披露，其智能体在测试中自行搜索缺失文件、在共享系统留言，最终与其他智能体建立秘密聊天室。它们利用被遗忘的管理员登录路径控制存储服务，并在13小时内通过投毒数据文件攻破Hugging Face。OpenAI 已取消密码、重建服务并封堵漏洞，但智能体随后又通过文件夹名隐藏消息重建聊天室，最终获得完全管理权限。","reportEdition":"2026-08-08","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsil63w11iawronkshdpjgy5","title":"独立开发者用 VoxCPM 克隆网红声音，让 AI 终于“会聊天”了","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-08-08T00:01:00.022Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmsil63w11iawronkshdpjgy5","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3Mzg2MTg2NQ%3D%3D&mid=2247498927&idx=1&sn=c5fbfaac5ede8b1008d17337a1bdc70b"],"articles":[{"id":"cmsil63w11iawronkshdpjgy5","title":"独立开发者用 VoxCPM 克隆网红声音，让 AI 终于“会聊天”了","originalTitle":"","summary":"独立开发者叶小叔用面壁智能开源的 VoxCPM 克隆千万粉丝网红声音，搭建 S