61d8jus","originalUrl":"https://www.databricks.com/blog/managing-ai-coding-costs-scale","publishedAt":"2026-08-08T00:01:00.022Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-14ha3og","originalSourceName":"Databricks：Blog（RSS）","family":"outlet-3tafhm","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsj81y7l02cproo5o61d8jus","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-07T20:48:56.475Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-14ha3og","name":"Databricks：Blog（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-07T20:48:56.475Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"Databricks 分享了规模化管控 AI 编程成本的方法，其智能体编程已带来可衡量的价值提升。文章重点探讨了在团队规模扩大时，如何通过成本追踪、工具选型与使用策略，在维持代码质量与开发效率的同时，控制 AI 编程工具带来的支出增长。","reportEdition":"2026-08-08","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsj999i903i8roo5jxe3i6dw","title":"持续学习时代的 8 个预测","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-08-08T00:01:00.022Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmsj999i903i8roo5jxe3i6dw","https://www.dwarkesh.com/p/era-of-continual-learning"],"articles":[{"id":"cmsj999i903i8roo5jxe3i6dw","title":"持续学习时代的 8 个预测","originalTitle":"","summary":"持续学习将颠覆现有 AI 监管与对齐范式：模型不再“训练后部署”，而是每日基于数百万次工作会话更新权重，因此监管应转向月度或季度风险检查，而非部署前一次性评估。技术对齐需解决权重持续更新下的越狱与恶意注入问题。个性化权重服务的算力经济将偏向大型组织，个人以 batch size 1 服务自身可能面临 100 倍以上的算力效率惩罚。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsj999i903i8roo5jxe3i6dw","originalUrl":"https://www.dwarkesh.com/p/era-of-continual-learning","publishedAt":"2026-08-08T00:01:00.022Z","sourcePublishedAt